# システム登録's 上書き (design 3.10.10, 11.32) on the x64 PC, for tools/x64/ui_run64.py with a
# second NVMe the system was put on beside Windows before (the KTWIN-C image after the
# sysinst group of tests/ktest/x86_64/ktest_sysinst.c, given as UI_EXTRA="-drive
# file=W.img,if=none,id=nv2,format=raw -device nvme,serial=win,drive=nv2"): the desktop is
# asked whether the TessronOS there can be kept (DT_SI_KEEPQ), 上書きする is offered and
# chosen, [開始] looks at the way with the objects kept and asks on the panel that does not
# warn, and 取消 puts it away; nothing is written.
logmark
open 01a0d8c4-54c0-7a11-8c22-4d5e6f7054c0
expectsincein 60 sysinst: opened 1
expectsincein 120 sysinst: keep nvmeb 0 -1: 0
waitwin システム登録 30
wait 500
shot sysinst64_keep_open
win システム登録
logmark
click 880 288
expectsincein 120 sysinst: plan nvmeb 256 -1: 0
expectsince sysinst: ask 登録
wait 800
shot sysinst64_keep_ask
key 29
expectsince sysinst: answered 0
wait 300
key 08 01
expectsince sysinst: closed
absent sysinst: started
absent !OACV!
